{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/111269","repository_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot","labels_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/111269/labels{/name}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/111269/comments","events_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/111269/events","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/111269","id":3484370486,"node_id":"I_kwDOAO6SJc7Pr0Y2","number":111269,"title":"Insertion of new sub-property Property Track doesn't distinguish the type between Discrete and Continuous","user":{"login":"TokageItLab","id":61938263,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjYxOTM4MjYz","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/61938263?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/TokageItLab","html_url":"https://github.com/TokageItLab","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TokageItLab/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TokageItLab/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TokageItLab/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TokageItLab/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TokageItLab/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TokageItLab/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TokageItLab/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TokageItLab/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TokageItLab/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"labels":[{"id":73330064,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWw3MzMzMDA2NA==","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/bug","name":"bug","color":"ff6055","default":true,"description":"","archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":279098219,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwyNzkwOTgyMTk=","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/topic:editor","name":"topic:editor","color":"ffee88","default":false,"description":"","archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":2666705648,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwyNjY2NzA1NjQ4","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/topic:animation","name":"topic:animation","color":"ffee88","default":false,"description":"","archived_at":null,"archived_by":null}],"state":"open","locked":false,"assignees":[],"milestone":null,"comments":0,"created_at":"2025-10-05T04:11:01Z","updated_at":"2025-10-06T00:43:59Z","closed_at":null,"assignee":null,"author_association":"MEMBER","issue_field_values":[],"type":null,"active_lock_reason":null,"sub_issues_summary":{"total":0,"completed":0,"percent_completed":0},"issue_dependencies_summary":{"blocked_by":0,"total_blocked_by":0,"blocking":0,"total_blocking":0},"body":"### Tested versions\n\n- 4.5.stable\n\n### System information\n\nAny\n\n### Issue description\n\nWhen adding a new Property Track (called as Value Track intanally) of sub-property, the UpdateMode is always set to Discrete.\n\n<img width=\"467\" height=\"434\" alt=\"Image\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/6dd019a0-c591-4849-a92c-ba87f185cf88\" />\n\n<img width=\"440\" height=\"165\" alt=\"Image\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/4bfeacd0-f82d-46c6-bae8-319c9bd48ac1\" />\n\nIf the type is float, the default should be Continuous, but sub-property type is ignored and always be Discrete.\n\n<img width=\"213\" height=\"111\" alt=\"Image\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/3a5776d0-ebbf-4f7b-ad66-9cc742fb9284\" />\n\nIf a RESET animation exists, its type is respected. The issue only occurs when adding a new track that does not exist in the RESET animation.\n\n<img width=\"748\" height=\"178\" alt=\"Image\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/763107f3-8db2-42ab-acd4-9747816ceeab\" />\n\nThe cause is due to the inability to correctly determine the type of a sub-property when it is passed to `_find_hint_for_track()` within `AnimationTrackEditor`. However, `_find_hint_for_track()` implementation is quite a hack to begin with.\n\n### Steps to reproduce\n\nInsert Property Track of sub-property by AnimationTrackEditor's `+` button\n\n<img width=\"260\" height=\"117\" alt=\"Image\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/f9bb694b-a60a-451b-9c06-c6cbd979f344\" />\n\n### Minimal reproduction project (MRP)\n\n[anim.zip](https://github.com/user-attachments/files/22705598/anim.zip)","closed_by":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/111269/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/111269/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reason":null,"pinned_comment":null}